		(property "Description" "Pull-down on PI_D0 (GPIO4): holds the line low while the Pi boots (GPIO0-8 come up with ~50 k pull-ups: 4.7 k against 50 k is 0.28 V, under the AHCT541's 0.8 V V_IL) and when no Pi is fitted"
