		(property "Description" "Reverse-polarity P-FET, high side: drain to the supply, source to the board. The body diode conducts first, then the gate (pulled to ground) turns it on at -12 V Vgs. Reversed, Vgs is positive and it stays off. 13 mohm, 0.3 W at 5 A"
			(at 759.46 30.48 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(hide yes)
